      "fine_trace_step": 4,
      "description": "Missing zero-entry guard. `dt_table` stores 1-based PT_DYNAMIC indices and leaves absent tags as 0. For the witnessed `elf_find_table_size(DT_SYMTAB, SHT_DYNSYM)` call, this line loads the zero sentinel from `dt_table[DT_SYMTAB]`, but vulnerable code does not stop when `x_ndx == 0` before indexing `dynseg[-1 + x_ndx]`."
